@page "/InstructionsKnownTopics"

@inherits InstructionsKnownTopicsPageBase

<MudText>The rule engine subscribes to all topics. Every received message is shown in the <MudLink Href="MessageExplorer">MQTT Message Explorer</MudLink>.</MudText>
<br />
<MudText>However, only known topics are relevant for the system. A <MudLink Href="KnownTopics">known topic</MudLink> is one the system knows about and works with.</MudText>
<br />
<MudText>The system stores the last payload of every known topic. You can read it later with the function Read("&lt;TopicName&gt;").</MudText>
<br />
<MudText>When a <MudLink Href="KnownMicrocontrollers">microcontroller</MudLink> with the IOTZOO firmware boots up, it sets up its supported topics automatically. The topics depend on the devices enabled by the #define lines in the firmware (lines that are commented out are disabled).</MudText>
<br />
